# The Goblin Tailor (jeuno 42): each chest's race operand alone (the week's location, no pattern, another race): the
# quest's nil, the chest's own script (its key opens it to its own loot). Accepted by a GM. Bob, a Hume female (race 2),
# at Gusgen Mines in week 1000 (location 1, race 1). Main, a Hume male (race 1), at the Maze of Shakhrami in week 1001
# (`wait vana=180`: location 2, race 2), then at Ordelle's Caves in week 1002 (`wait vana=192` more: location 0, race 3).
lists GusgenMines/Treasure_Chest/onTrade MazeOfShakhrami/Treasure_Chest/onTrade OrdellesCaves/Treasure_Chest/onTrade
char zone=MazeOfShakhrami pos=-342.6,-11.2,-166.2 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=GusgenMines pos=208.7,-59.2,-101 job=WAR lvl=75 race=2
quest Jeuno.TheGoblinTailor accepted
item ShakhramiChestKey
item OrdelleChestKey
bob: quest Jeuno.TheGoblinTailor accepted
bob: item GusgenChestKey
login
bob: login
tick 13000                              # the chests placed
bob: trigger Treasure_Chest             # walks to the chest
bob: trade Treasure_Chest GusgenChestKey x1 # week 1000: location 1, race 1 is not 2: nil; the chest's own script
tick 4500                               # the chest opened
wait vana=180                           # week 1001 (race 2, location 2)
trigger Treasure_Chest                  # walks to the chest
trade Treasure_Chest ShakhramiChestKey x1 # location 2, race 2 is not 1: nil; the chest's own script
tick 4500                               # the chest opened
wait vana=192                           # week 1002 (race 3, location 0)
warp -49.4,-1.07,7.2 OrdellesCaves
tick 13000                              # the chest placed
trigger Treasure_Chest                  # walks to the chest
trade Treasure_Chest OrdelleChestKey x1 # location 0, race 3 is not 1: nil; the chest's own script
tick 4500                               # the chest opened
